🔷 B – Business Process

Business Requirement:
Send automated, well-formatted booking confirmation emails to both the customer who made the
booking and the recipient (if applicable), immediately after the booking is created in an external system.

Key Business Points:

Booking comes from a third-party system (via HTTP).
Must notify both parties (booker and recipient).
Email should be user-friendly (HTML format).
Handle errors gracefully (e.g., invalid email, delivery issues).
Ensure traceability for monitoring and support.

